<title>USA: Sabretech says sues ValuJet.</title>
<headline>Sabretech says sues ValuJet.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>SabreTech Inc said Tuesday it filed a suit against ValuJet Airlines Inc asserting that ValuJet is required to indemnify SabreTech for all of its damages relating to the crash of ValuJet Flight 592.</p>
</text>
